  "title": "Maimonides",
  "summary": "Maimonides was born in Cordoba, Spain, in 1138 (EBSCO gives 1135), left Spain with his family after the Almohad invasion of 1148, reached Fez in 1160 and Egypt in 1166. He settled in Fustat in Cairo, completed his Guide of the Perplexed in 1190, became a noted physician, and died in 1204.",
